-- Add SR1, dogleg and cubic regularization (editorial scope TOPIC_SR1 / TOPIC_DOGLEG / TOPIC_CUBIC_REGULARIZATION).
-- SR1 is placed in MF_SMOOTH_LOCAL with BFGS/L-BFGS (a Hessian-approximation update); its trust-region pairing is kept in related_method_ids.
-- Dogleg is placed in MF_TRUST_REGION. Cubic regularization is placed in MF_SMOOTH_LOCAL: its globalization is a regularization
-- weight, not a trust radius, and it is the Newton method with a cubic term (see M_NEWTON).
-- No implementation rows: the existing SciPy implementation rows are per-solver and none covers dogleg, trust-exact or SR1.
PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;

